sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Cron as Cron Job / Scheduler
  participant Lock as Lock Mechanism (MongoDB/Redis)
  participant Worker as ReminderJob Worker
  participant DS as DeadlineService
  participant DB as MongoDB Collections
  participant NS as NotificationService
  participant FE as React Frontend (User Session)

  Cron->>Worker: Trigger Scheduled Check (Hourly / Daily)
  Worker->>Lock: Acquire Execution Lock ("reminder_runner_lock")
  alt Lock acquisition fails (Another instance running)
    Lock-->>Worker: Lock unavailable
    Worker-->>Cron: Abort execution (Avoid duplicate run)
  else Lock acquired successfully
    Lock-->>Worker: Lock granted (TTL 5 mins)
    Worker->>DS: findDueReminders(currentDate)
    
    DS->>DB: Deadline.find({ status: "pending", isConfirmed: true, dueDate: { $gte: now } })
    DB-->>DS: candidateDeadlines[]

    loop For each candidate deadline
      DS->>DS: Evaluate if today matches (dueDate - reminderDaysBefore)
      alt Reminder is due AND not already notified today
        DS->>NS: dispatchReminder(deadline, user)
        NS->>DB: Notification.create({ userId, deadlineId, type: "deadline_reminder" })
        NS->>DB: Deadline.updateOne({ _id: deadline._id }, { lastNotifiedAt: now })
        opt If user enabled email alerts
          NS->>NS: Send email notification via SMTP adapter
        end
      else Already notified or not matching day
        DS->>DS: Skip (Prevent duplicate notification)
      end
    end

    Worker->>Lock: Release Execution Lock
    Worker-->>Cron: Run completed successfully
  end

  Note over FE,DB: User Visits Dashboard
  FE->>DB: GET /api/notifications (authenticated)
  DB-->>FE: Return unread notifications[]
  FE->>FE: Display badge counter & notification list

